{"id":"wb-8-367","name":"登封玉溪宫","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"登封玉溪宫","text":"登封玉溪宫位于中华人民共和国河南省登封市唐庄镇土观村，2019年被公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n玉溪宫原名瑜栖宫，又名土观，始建于明，清朝时重修。现存建筑有明代玉皇殿和清代大苦殿、三官殿，另有散存于宫内外的明至民国碑刻和石雕十余件。\n\n玉皇殿面阔三间，进深三间，单檐歇山顶，覆琉璃瓦。檐下施双昂五踩斗拱，前后檐各六朵，两山各五朵，另有四朵角拱。脊两端置龙吻，正脊饰琉璃彩色莲花和二龙戏珠。大苦殿和三官殿均面阔三间，进深一间，五架梁，无柱，硬山顶，覆灰色筒瓦。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BB%E5%B0%81%E7%8E%89%E6%BA%AA%E5%AE%AB","revisionId":89632284,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89632284","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8709228bbdeab49f97611989.jpg","title":"20250608_Yuxi_Gong_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250608_Yuxi_Gong_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/20250608_Yuxi_Gong_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​登封玉溪宫","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}